  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "'Justice Knight' is a Raythean Exister-S1044 Model four-wheeled operation platform customized by a Kazimierzian engineer, later remodeled and upgraded by Mayer and Closure. Owing to its main searchlight function lacking use value, and its cover fire capacity being limited in its target market, its production has been halted. Before the Rhodes Island Engineering Department got their hands on her, 'Justice Knight' had already gone through a dozen modifications, big and small; her present capabilities are easily a far cry from the original model. Her old operating system and command memory data were damaged, unable to be recovered. After a swap for new core hardware and an expanded memory unit, an updated operating system plus additional artificial voice system, she is now hardly distinguishable from Raythean Industries's latest operation platforms. 'Justice Knight' is a member of Pinus Sylvestris Knightclub, and is currently authorized for use by Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "“正义骑士号”是由卡西米尔工程师客制化后的雷神存在者S-1044四轮作业平台，后由梅尔与可露希尔进行改造和升级。其原型产品由于主要提供的探照功能缺少使用价值，援护射击功能市场受众范围小，现已停产。在罗德岛工程部经手前，“正义骑士号”已经历过大大小小十余次的改造，现功能与原型可以说相去甚远。旧版操作系统与指令存储数据已完全损坏，无法找回。在更换了核心硬件设备、扩充存储装置、更新操作系统、添加人工语音系统之后，现与雷神工业新版作业平台性能相差无几。“正义骑士号”原为红松骑士团成员，目前授权给罗德岛使用。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Thanks to all manner of upgrades her original master, Wild Mane, has carried out on her, aside from her initial cover fire capacity, 'Justice Knight' has grown a list of everyday abilities, such as watering flowers, transporting takeout, recharging game consoles... For 'Justice Knight,' providing quick and convenient service is one of her callings. Her previous abandonment very much weighs on her, and ever since her retrieval and rebooting by Wild Mane, outside of recharging and maintenance hours, she'll actively hang around with others.",
        "zh": "由于原主人野鬃曾对其进行过各类改造委托，“正义骑士号”除了最初的射击援护功能以外，增添了更多日常性功能，如浇花、外卖运输、游戏机充电……对于“正义骑士号”来说，为人们提供便捷的生活服务是自己的使命之一。对自己曾被遗弃过很在意，在被野鬃捡回并重启后，除了充电与维修时间，她都会积极地和人们待在一起。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    }
  ]
}
